WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.880
When your prisons are filled with so-called asylum seekers

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.880
who repaid kindness, and that's what they did.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.920
They repaid kindness with crime.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.640
It's time to end the failed experiment of open borders.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.000
You have to end it now.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.920
See, I can tell you.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.559
I'm really good at this stuff.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:18.080
Your countries are going to hell.

